Even safer guard
Right before every remove, do this:

if (removeOffset < 0 || removeOffset > doc.getLength()) {
    throw new IllegalStateException("Bad remove offset: " + removeOffset + ", docLen=" + doc.getLength());
}
if (removeLen < 0 || removeOffset + removeLen > doc.getLength()) {
