My blunt recommendation
For line movement in JTextComponent:

use Utilities.getRowStart

use Utilities.getRowEnd

treat newlines explicitly

clamp every remove range against doc.getLength()

Do not trust Element.getEndOffset() for mutation logic on the last line unless you enjoy pain as a hobby.

